{"3078760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LIVING HELL", "steam_appid": 3078760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/712b58d84f7f0fcab7b5e06ae8a34f40.poster.avif?t=1787410048\" width=960 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/712b58d84f7f0fcab7b5e06ae8a34f40.webm?t=1787410048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/712b58d84f7f0fcab7b5e06ae8a34f40.mp4?t=1787410048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">​​<strong>LIVING HELL</strong> is a 1–4 player co-op survival horror game set in Pelican City. The collapse of the ozone layer exposed the city to devastating solar radiation, triggering widespread and terrifying mutations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ESCAPE THE NIGHTMARE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">​​Your only way across the city is the abandoned subway. Keep the train running, travel through seven unique districts and reach one of the remaining rocket launch sites before it’s too late.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/1c3ebbd530bb5128a4f40c75f8537199.poster.avif?t=1787410048\" width=960 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/1c3ebbd530bb5128a4f40c75f8537199.webm?t=1787410048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/1c3ebbd530bb5128a4f40c75f8537199.mp4?t=1787410048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FUEL YOUR RIDE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">​​Leave the safety of the train and explore dangerous, handcrafted locations in search of mutated specimens. Process them into biofuel and scavenge materials to craft what you'll need to survive the journey ahead.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/e4e0a05df3aca30e4d3caefd16f21a1f.poster.avif?t=1787410048\" width=960 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/e4e0a05df3aca30e4d3caefd16f21a1f.webm?t=1787410048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/e4e0a05df3aca30e4d3caefd16f21a1f.mp4?t=1787410048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>TRUST NO ONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">​​The blistering heat is a threat of its own. Manage your Thermal Load and find ways to stay cool, or risk mutating and turning against your own teammates.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/20440ecc298aea004fa88d5394939676.poster.avif?t=1787410048\" width=960 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/20440ecc298aea004fa88d5394939676.webm?t=1787410048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/20440ecc298aea004fa88d5394939676.mp4?t=1787410048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A DIFFERENT JOURNEY EVERY TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">​​Each journey through Pelican City follows a different subway route, changing the path you take to reach the launch site. Along the way, face a variety of mutated creatures, each with their own unique behaviours.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/e888694f073062c33ea12849853e9276.poster.avif?t=1787410048\" width=960 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/e888694f073062c33ea12849853e9276.webm?t=1787410048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/e888694f073062c33ea12849853e9276.mp4?t=1787410048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>1–4 player online co-op and full offline single-player<br></li><li>Numerous unique locations across multiple subway routes<br></li><li>More than a dozen mutated creatures with unique behaviours<br></li><li>Six playable characters with unique passive abilities<br></li><li>Immersive proximity voice chat with lip-sync and handheld radios<br></li><li>Crafting and inventory systems inspired by classic survival horror<br></li><li>Persistent save files across sessions<br></li><li>Full gamepad and Steam Deck support<br></li><li>Original score by Mario Sello Nuñez</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/712b58d84f7f0fcab7b5e06ae8a34f40.poster.avif?t=1787410048\" width=960 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/712b58d84f7f0fcab7b5e06ae8a34f40.webm?t=1787410048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/712b58d84f7f0fcab7b5e06ae8a34f40.mp4?t=1787410048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">​​<strong>LIVING HELL</strong> is a 1–4 player co-op survival horror game set in Pelican City. The collapse of the ozone layer exposed the city to devastating solar radiation, triggering widespread and terrifying mutations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ESCAPE THE NIGHTMARE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">​​Your only way across the city is the abandoned subway. Keep the train running, travel through seven unique districts and reach one of the remaining rocket launch sites before it’s too late.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/1c3ebbd530bb5128a4f40c75f8537199.poster.avif?t=1787410048\" width=960 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/1c3ebbd530bb5128a4f40c75f8537199.webm?t=1787410048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/1c3ebbd530bb5128a4f40c75f8537199.mp4?t=1787410048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FUEL YOUR RIDE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">​​Leave the safety of the train and explore dangerous, handcrafted locations in search of mutated specimens. Process them into biofuel and scavenge materials to craft what you'll need to survive the journey ahead.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/e4e0a05df3aca30e4d3caefd16f21a1f.poster.avif?t=1787410048\" width=960 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/e4e0a05df3aca30e4d3caefd16f21a1f.webm?t=1787410048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/e4e0a05df3aca30e4d3caefd16f21a1f.mp4?t=1787410048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>TRUST NO ONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">​​The blistering heat is a threat of its own. Manage your Thermal Load and find ways to stay cool, or risk mutating and turning against your own teammates.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/20440ecc298aea004fa88d5394939676.poster.avif?t=1787410048\" width=960 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/20440ecc298aea004fa88d5394939676.webm?t=1787410048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/20440ecc298aea004fa88d5394939676.mp4?t=1787410048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A DIFFERENT JOURNEY EVERY TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">​​Each journey through Pelican City follows a different subway route, changing the path you take to reach the launch site. Along the way, face a variety of mutated creatures, each with their own unique behaviours.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078760/extras/e888694f073062c33ea12849853e9276.poster.avif?t=1787410048\" width=960 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steam